.\" troff/man: a manual page for the install script.
.TH COPY 1 "September 2026" "native-file-editor 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
copy.bat \- install the built plugin into a vault
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B copy.bat
.RI [ vault-path ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copies
.BR main.js ", " manifest.json " and " styles.css
into the vault's plugin folder, keeping
.IR data.json .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B NFE_VAULT
The vault used when no argument is given.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR clean.cmd (1)
